// The textedit package: an editing core for text and code, the commands that undo it, and a multi-line
// code editor widget on uilayout.
//
// THE CORE (no window, no GPU, no uilayout):
//   history.cone   History[C]: a general undo/redo command history any editor can reuse
//   buffer.cone    Buffer: a piece-table text buffer with a line index, for large files
//   doc.cone       Doc: a Buffer with multiple carets and selections, the editing operations (type, delete,
//                  newline with auto-indent, indent, paste, move by character, word, line, page) and undo
//   find.cone      literal find and replace (case, whole word) over a Buffer or a Doc
//   highlight.cone Token, the highlighter interface (a line function with a carried state), SyntaxTheme
//   conelex.cone   coneTokenizer: Cone source, from the manual's lexical rules
// THE WIDGET:
//   editor.cone    Editor: a hosted uilayout node with a gutter, scrolling, selections, syntax colours,
//                  bracket matching and the keyboard and mouse; its draw list goes through uilayout's
//
// See Design\textedit.md for the design, the methods chosen and the open questions.

mod textedit;

import collections use *;
import geomath use *;
import uilayout use *;
